    "decides), visheart-retraining/tests/test_eligibility.py (the training job's own check) and",
    "visheart-frontend/tests/extend-training-logic.test.mjs (the Prepare tab's summary and gate).",
    "The server builds 'dryRun' from 'projects' and must match it exactly; the page and the training job then count",
    "'expected' from that same dry run. Change a rule, and all three must agree again."
